o</a></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid220\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\">Wie geht es dem Hyper Sentinel Kikstarter </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid221\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958 url\"><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/robhwson/hyper-sentinel\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/robhwson/hyper-sentinel</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid222\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid223\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962\">Es gibt ja immer noch eine AMIGA Zeitschrift 🙂 Die &#8222;Amiga Future&#8220;</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid224\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962 url\"><a href=\"http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/amiga-future-121/\">http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/amiga-future-121/</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid225\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid226\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962\">Tronimal brigt eine limitierte Edition des GameBoy Musik Moduls heraus (100 stueck) &#8222;Hello_World&#8220;</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid227\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962 url\"><a href=\"http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/tronimal-hello-world/\">http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/tronimal-hello-world/</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid228\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid229\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962\">Schoener Retro-Manga-Shooter als Kickstarter &#8222;Xydonia&#8220;</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid230\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962 url\"><a href=\"http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/kickstarter-xydonia/\">http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/kickstarter-xydonia/</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid231\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid232\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962\">&#8222;Neues&#8220; C64 Spiel Bongo King nach 30 JAhre tatsaechlich fertig 🙂</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid233\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962 url\"><a href=\"http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/c64-spiel-bongo-king-19862016/\">http://www.retromagazine.eu/retro/2016-07/c64-spiel-bongo-king-19862016/</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid243\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid244\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962 url\"><a href=\"http://www.gameinformer.com/b/news/archive/2016/06/30/nintendo-shuts-down-nes-famicom-visual-compendium-kickstarter.aspx\">http://www.gameinformer.com/b/news/archive/2016/06/30/nintendo-shuts-down-nes-famicom-visual-compendium-kickstarter.aspx</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid245\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid246\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962\">Unsere News bei GamersGlobal:</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid247\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75962 url\"><a href=\"http://www.gamersglobal.de/news/116259/retrokompott-folge-16-autorennspiele-auf-dem-c64\">http://www.gamersglobal.de/news/116259/retrokompott-folge-16-autorennspiele-auf-dem-c64</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid248\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<